# LMS Monorepo Environment Configuration
#
# Environment variables in this monorepo are scoped to each respective workspace:
#   - Backend API:         apps/api/.env.example
#   - Authenticated SPA:   apps/app/.env.example
#   - Marketing SSR:       apps/web/.env.example
#
# For Docker Compose / Dokploy deployments:
#   See .env.compose.example (or run "pnpm env:compose" to regenerate)
